# L §5.18 solve: "The grid is lo + i·u, and lo and hi must lie on it": [0, 3] with u = 2 leaves 3 off the grid, refused
# at load where the literals show it (L §8.4: LOAD-DOMAIN).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input xv: num
input target: num
def sq: num = xv * xv at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  xv = 1
  target = 2

ask a: solve sq == target for xv in [0, 3] to 2 law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-DOMAIN ...
